<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
	<head>
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	</head>
	<body style="font-family:Verdana;color:#aaaaaa;">

		<div style="background-color:#ffff;padding:15px;text-align:center;">
			<img src="https://backend.leadagro.net/logo.png" alt="Logo DEPPS" style="height: 60px; width: auto; margin-right: 15px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;">
			<img src="https://backend.leadagro.net/depps.jpeg" alt="Logo DEPPS" style="height: 60px; width: auto; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;">
		</div>
		<hr size="10" style="background-color:#2AD10F;">

		<div style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; color: #000;">
			<p style="font-size:16px;font-weight:bolder;">Nouvelle demande de retrait</p>

			<p>Une nouvelle demande de retrait a été enregistrée sur la plateforme. Voici les références :</p>

			<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 480px;">
				<tr>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Référence</td>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{ retrait.reference }}</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Montant</td>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{ retrait.montant }} FCFA</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Numéro (mobile money)</td>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{ retrait.telephone }}</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">Demandé par</td>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{ retrait.demandePar }}</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px; font-weight: bold;">Date de la demande</td>
					<td style="padding: 6px 10px;">{{ retrait.date }}</td>
				</tr>
			</table>
		</div>

		<br>
		<div style="background-color:#4b9bd8;text-align:center;padding:10px;margin-top:7px;">
			<h3 style="color: white;">© copyright DEPPS</h3>
		</div>

	</body>
</html>
